        "ggu2vb76Nw5_text": "<p>\"My doctor asked what I was doing differently. I said 'eating tar from the Himalayas.' He did not laugh.\"</p>",
        "ggk5LbXatBy_text": "<p>T-levels up 23% in 90 days. No injections, no prescription. My wife says I'm 'annoyingly energetic' now. I'll take it.</p>",
        "ggU_N-qYNiq_text": "<p><strong>- James K., 61, Phoenix AZ&nbsp;</strong></p>",
        "ggRbExvtONZ_text": "<p>\"I initiated on a Tuesday. We never do anything on Tuesdays. She was suspicious.\"</p>",
        "ggOoIsYHixw_text": "<p>She literally asked if I was having an affair. Nope. Just finally feel like myself again. Like the guy she married.</p>",
        "ggLThJwXJb3_text": "<p><strong>- Michael T., 52, Denver CO</strong></p>"
      }
    },
