        "gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_6": "<p>What if it doesn't work for me?</p>",
        "gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_7": "<p>Is my order discreet?</p>",
        "gg4a8x2zCkC_text": "<p>Our Himalayan Purity Protocol™ uses cold-filtration technology to remove heavy metalswhile preserving the beneficial bioactive compounds. Most supplements skip this step — meaning you get the toxins along with the minerals.</p>",
        "ggRqXQmTkxv_text": "<p>Most men notice initial improvements within 2 weeks. 94% report improved morning energy by day 14. We recommend committing to at least 90 days for optimal results.</p>",
